/-!
# The list of quasithin K-groups: supporting results

Aschbacher–Smith, *The Classification of Quasithin Groups*, combined manuscript
(1 March 2004), §A.2, pp. 32–41. Theorems A.2.1–A.2.3 are proved simultaneously
by induction on group order, reducing to quasisimple groups and then treating
the alternating, odd-characteristic, characteristic-two, and sporadic families.

The current imports prove all five quotient-rank inequalities of Lemma A.2.7,
binary unitary and linear odd-center recognition,
and the projective three-rank bounds used in A.2.12 and A.2.18.
The section's classification theorems still require the remaining reductions
and family-specific local structure results; they are not asserted here.
-/
